WEBVTT

00:00.470 --> 00:01.330
<b>Get down!</b>

00:09.360 --> 00:12.250
<b>Finally, I got one of you to show.</b>

00:12.250 --> 00:14.620
<b>Fall back! Get to the surface without me!</b>

00:14.620 --> 00:16.000
<b>Iska?!</b>

00:16.000 --> 00:18.460
<b>I can manage if it's just me.</b>

00:18.460 --> 00:19.380
<b>Now, go!</b>

00:22.880 --> 00:26.130
<b>Are you the former Saint Disciple, Iska?</b>

00:27.020 --> 00:29.070
<b>Are you here to rescue someone?</b>

00:29.070 --> 00:31.560
<b>Or are you here for these earrings?</b>

00:31.890 --> 00:33.380
<b>Where's Sisbell?</b>

00:33.710 --> 00:35.990
<b>Yes, where is Sisbell?</b>

00:37.210 --> 00:38.060
<b>This light...</b>

00:40.160 --> 00:43.650
<b>I'll make you my shining pawn.</b>

00:45.360 --> 00:46.480
<b>She's going to attack...</b>

00:46.880 --> 00:48.120
<b>Glory.</b>

01:09.450 --> 01:14.630
<b>Our Last Crusade or the Rise of a New World</b>

02:19.590 --> 02:26.480
<b>Morning Star: Welcome 
with a Round of Applause</b>

02:19.780 --> 02:21.740
<b>Your disrespect has gone too far, Hydra.</b>

02:22.030 --> 02:26.500
<b>Not toward the queen,
but disrespect towards me.</b>

02:26.500 --> 02:30.040
<b>Who gave you the right to attack Mira?!</b>

02:30.580 --> 02:33.460
<b>You brought upheaval on the Sovereignty.</b>

02:33.460 --> 02:38.050
<b>I shall expose everything 
to the light of day!</b>

02:40.130 --> 02:44.850
<b>Now, anyone with the knowledge of where 
Gregorio's secret spell is, come forth.</b>

02:46.220 --> 02:48.270
<b>So the spell is up above?</b>

02:48.270 --> 02:49.640
<b>Now, get lost!</b>

02:53.520 --> 02:56.280
<b>The planet is full of anger.</b>

02:56.280 --> 02:58.780
<b>Is this where the spell is?</b>

02:58.780 --> 03:02.070
<b>No, this is where you'll die.</b>

03:02.450 --> 03:07.240
<b>Salinger the Transcendent? 
Yum, you're my type.</b>

03:07.240 --> 03:09.750
<b>It's almost a shame to burn you.</b>

03:10.040 --> 03:13.920
<b>Tri-Stage: Fusion between 
humans and astral spirits.</b>

03:13.920 --> 03:18.170
<b>Anyone who has achieved this will 
transcend as an astral mage,</b>

03:18.170 --> 03:20.800
<b>taking themselves to a whole new level.</b>

03:21.220 --> 03:23.760
<b>Only two people in the history of this planet</b>

03:23.760 --> 03:26.510
<b>were able to achieve this on their own.</b>

03:26.510 --> 03:30.350
<b>Founder Nebulis and Emperor Yunmelngen.</b>

03:30.600 --> 03:36.940
<b>For decades, Hydra has been experimenting 
with an artificial way to do this.</b>

03:37.190 --> 03:39.570
<b>You're one of the subjects 
of that experimentation.</b>

03:39.570 --> 03:41.200
<b>Vichyssoise.</b>

03:41.570 --> 03:45.370
<b>I hate being called a test subject. 
Call me by my name, will ya?</b>

03:45.570 --> 03:47.950
<b>You want me to remember your name?</b>

03:47.950 --> 03:51.660
<b>Your arrogance is too great 
for your own good, girl.</b>

03:51.660 --> 03:54.040
<b>Man, what a shame.</b>

03:54.040 --> 03:57.800
<b>An astral mage from the past trying 
to make it in the present day?</b>

03:57.800 --> 04:00.590
<b>The curtain to your stage has 
dropped down a long time ago.</b>

04:00.590 --> 04:02.340
<b>Clueless girl.</b>

04:02.340 --> 04:07.430
<b>It isn't that I go on stage. 
Where I am becomes the stage.</b>

04:07.430 --> 04:09.680
<b>Hence my line before.</b>

04:09.680 --> 04:12.480
<b>Welcome me, with a round of applause!</b>

04:15.020 --> 04:16.810
<b>What is going on?!</b>

04:17.270 --> 04:18.650
<b>Salinger...</b>

04:18.940 --> 04:22.440
<b>Salinger? Jhin, do you remember who that is?</b>

04:22.440 --> 04:26.280
<b>No. If we don't remember, 
he's probably not a big deal.</b>

04:26.280 --> 04:28.450
<b>"Big deal" doesn't even 
begin to cover who he is!</b>

04:28.450 --> 04:32.870
<b>Salinger is our nation's 
biggest, baddest criminal!</b>

04:32.870 --> 04:36.710
<b>He's the great evil that attacked 
the former queen thirty years ago.</b>

04:36.710 --> 04:39.380
<b>Cystea, surely you must've misheard.</b>

04:39.630 --> 04:41.550
<b>Private soldiers are shouting his name.</b>

04:42.010 --> 04:45.550
<b>Captain Mismis, enemy security 
has fallen into chaos.</b>

04:45.550 --> 04:47.430
<b>We must seize this opportunity!</b>

04:47.850 --> 04:48.760
<b>Right.</b>

04:49.010 --> 04:51.350
<b>Everyone, let's evacuate quickly!</b>

04:52.600 --> 04:55.480
<b>A big explosion at Snow the Sun?!</b>

04:55.890 --> 04:58.230
<b>Lady Alice, please, not so loud.</b>

04:58.230 --> 04:59.650
<b>B-But...</b>

05:00.270 --> 05:04.740
<b>Iska and others engaged in battle? 
Does that mean they were spotted?</b>

05:04.740 --> 05:06.660
<b>This is a serious problem.</b>

05:08.570 --> 05:11.660
<b>It's only been a few days since 
the attack by the Imperial army.</b>

05:11.660 --> 05:14.410
<b>It isn't hard to believe the remaining 
soldiers may be in hiding.</b>

05:14.410 --> 05:15.540
<b>Hey, you there.</b>

05:16.040 --> 05:17.580
<b>Send in a security team--</b>

05:17.580 --> 05:19.130
<b>This is not the doing of 
the remaining soldiers,</b>

05:20.000 --> 05:21.960
<b>but of Salinger the Demon.</b>

05:22.340 --> 05:24.260
<b>Are you sure the information is correct?</b>

05:24.470 --> 05:29.090
<b>Yes, they've got a match on facial 
recognition from the security camera.</b>

05:30.350 --> 05:31.220
<b>Rin?</b>

05:31.220 --> 05:33.680
<b>I-I know nothing either!</b>

05:33.680 --> 05:36.690
<b>The last I saw of that man was in Alcatroz,</b>

05:36.690 --> 05:40.020
<b>and no one was able to track him 
down after his prison break.</b>

05:43.110 --> 05:46.820
<b>Salinger... What are you up to?</b>

05:47.740 --> 05:52.370
<b>Why would Salinger, who went into hiding,
suddenly show up now?</b>

05:54.120 --> 05:56.120
<b>Let's continue our meeting.</b>

05:56.120 --> 06:00.130
<b>If we know the culprit,
the situation will be under control.</b>

06:00.130 --> 06:01.840
<b>That's unlike you.</b>

06:02.380 --> 06:02.880
<b>Hmm?</b>

06:03.300 --> 06:07.630
<b>Why would that infamous 
demon cause destruction?</b>

06:07.630 --> 06:12.140
<b>Normally, you would have asked 
that question, Lord Talisman.</b>

06:12.510 --> 06:17.060
<b>Perhaps you know why he 
is targeting Snow the Sun?</b>

06:17.060 --> 06:19.270
<b>I haven't the slightest clue.</b>

06:19.270 --> 06:22.730
<b>His motives will be clear once 
we catch and interrogate him.</b>

06:23.020 --> 06:25.440
<b>You think you can catch that demon?</b>

06:25.860 --> 06:31.780
<b>Since Imperial soldiers can attack at 
any time, our security is watertight.</b>

06:32.910 --> 06:37.200
<b>That means he's prepared to 
fight off Iska and his team.</b>

06:46.130 --> 06:49.050
<b>Hmm, power wasn't that bad.</b>

06:49.050 --> 06:52.010
<b>I'd say that was enhanced 
by about three levels?</b>

06:52.010 --> 06:54.970
<b>Now, get up, Iska.</b>

06:54.970 --> 06:56.600
<b>How long are you going to pretend to be down?</b>

06:56.850 --> 06:58.930
<b>Vichyssois told me already:</b>

06:58.930 --> 07:01.230
<b>Never think you've won.</b>

07:01.230 --> 07:05.940
<b>Even if you slice him into five, six 
pieces, make sure he's actually dead.</b>

07:08.650 --> 07:10.240
<b>I resent that statement...</b>

07:11.700 --> 07:15.620
<b>You really are alive. Maybe you're immortal?</b>

07:15.620 --> 07:21.290
<b>Of course not. I also wasn't 
pretending to be down.</b>

07:21.710 --> 07:26.500
<b>Is her ability to give her own astral 
energy to another's astral spirit?</b>

07:26.500 --> 07:28.630
<b>It did more than just "enhance" it...</b>

07:28.630 --> 07:31.380
<b>Trying to figure out what my ability is?</b>

07:32.260 --> 07:35.800
<b>The more you know, the bigger the imagination, 
making you second guess yourself.</b>

07:36.720 --> 07:39.100
<b>Keep second guessing, and die.</b>

07:40.770 --> 07:42.390
<b>She has more?!</b>

07:43.690 --> 07:47.480
<b>I'll make you my shining pawn.</b>

07:50.490 --> 07:51.400
<b>A mine?!</b>

07:54.870 --> 07:58.990
<b>I can't believe I'm using two 
pawns just for one assassin.</b>

07:58.990 --> 08:01.210
<b>Maybe this is too warm of a welcome?</b>

08:05.290 --> 08:06.540
<b>You withstood that, too?!</b>

08:07.340 --> 08:10.960
<b>Did you think you got me?!</b>

08:16.800 --> 08:18.600
<b>That was close...!</b>

08:18.930 --> 08:20.430
<b>It went exactly the way I wanted it to.</b>

08:21.770 --> 08:23.440
<b>My earring!</b>

08:23.440 --> 08:25.940
<b>It's important, isn't it?</b>

08:26.940 --> 08:27.900
<b>Give it back!</b>

08:30.650 --> 08:34.150
<b>You know what we want! Keep that in mind!</b>

08:37.950 --> 08:42.120
<b>Astral art like that won't hurt me at all.</b>

08:42.120 --> 08:44.330
<b>Come on, burn to a crisp!</b>

08:48.880 --> 08:52.460
<b>Do not attack me with such filthy flame.</b>

08:53.220 --> 08:54.340
<b>So annoying!</b>

08:56.010 --> 08:59.300
<b>An astral mage can't 
create a flame like this.</b>

08:59.300 --> 09:04.390
<b>Whether you're a royalty of the Founder's 
descendants or a powerful astral mage,</b>

09:04.940 --> 09:10.320
<b>they can't beat a witch that 
fused with an astral spirit!</b>

09:12.650 --> 09:14.740
<b>I see you only know one trick.</b>

09:18.030 --> 09:21.620
<b>Now, do you understand the 
difference between us?</b>

09:21.870 --> 09:28.170
<b>The royalties feared your "water reflection" 
that can steal from astral spirits,</b>

09:28.170 --> 09:30.590
<b>but you can only steal half of its power.</b>

09:30.590 --> 09:33.840
<b>In short, your power is just a 
hodge-podge. That's not gonna—</b>

09:32.960 --> 09:36.260
<b>You're thoughtless, with 
no manners and no game,</b>

09:36.260 --> 09:38.220
<b>but most of all, you have no grace.</b>

09:38.220 --> 09:40.850
<b>I suppose that's expected 
from a girl like you.</b>

09:40.850 --> 09:42.970
<b>You think there's a power 
difference between us,</b>

09:42.970 --> 09:46.980
<b>when I have yet to show you 
anything that resembles power?</b>

09:47.850 --> 09:50.270
<b>You got my attention!</b>

09:50.270 --> 09:54.230
<b>It wouldn't be fun to just 
torch you with my astral flame.</b>

09:54.230 --> 09:57.200
<b>I'll crush you with my Magic Bullet.</b>

09:57.200 --> 10:02.240
<b>Astral spirit of exploding earth,
blast up with your rage!</b>

10:04.040 --> 10:07.790
<b>I have many tricks up my sleeve to kill you.</b>

10:07.790 --> 10:09.290
<b>You!</b>

10:09.540 --> 10:13.960
<b>Pathetic. You're a monster 
who's all bark and no bite.</b>

10:16.720 --> 10:21.890
<b>Who could have infiltrated 
this facility before I did?</b>

10:23.140 --> 10:24.180
<b>Snow?</b>

10:24.180 --> 10:26.640
<b>Stop, Imperial soldier!</b>

10:27.140 --> 10:28.520
<b>Grugell?!</b>

10:29.400 --> 10:34.530
<b>Hm? You're the ex-Saint 
Disciple, Iska, was it?</b>

10:46.160 --> 10:49.460
<b>How dare you use me?</b>

10:49.460 --> 10:52.210
<b>I don't know what you're talking about.</b>

10:52.210 --> 10:55.590
<b>I'd love to take the time 
to just enjoy this view,</b>

10:55.590 --> 10:58.880
<b>but I have some bones to 
pick with your friends.</b>

10:58.880 --> 11:01.010
<b>I must go kill them.</b>

11:01.010 --> 11:02.220
<b>Pierce him.</b>

11:05.930 --> 11:07.470
<b>Release!</b>

11:09.480 --> 11:13.400
<b>Are these Mizerhyby's flames?</b>

11:14.270 --> 11:15.900
<b>Curses, Saint Disciple!</b>

11:18.740 --> 11:20.820
<b>I'll take you on when 
we're on the battlefield.</b>

11:24.450 --> 11:28.700
<b>Alice, have you made any 
progress with Sisbell's rescue?</b>

11:29.290 --> 11:33.420
<b>No, Mother. If there was an update,
I'd have been informed.</b>

11:33.750 --> 11:34.960
<b>I see...</b>

11:36.130 --> 11:39.880
<b>Mother, I do have one thing on my mind.</b>

11:40.760 --> 11:42.510
<b>It's about Salinger, isn't it?</b>

11:42.510 --> 11:46.970
<b>Yes. Why is Salinger attacking Snow the Sun?</b>

11:47.390 --> 11:49.180
<b>I don't know.</b>

11:49.890 --> 11:53.060
<b>Since we parted ways after 
the incident 30 years ago,</b>

11:53.060 --> 11:56.650
<b>I have no idea what goes 
inside that mind of his.</b>

11:58.980 --> 12:02.450
<b>I let the great criminal who 
attacked the former queen loose.</b>

12:02.450 --> 12:04.990
<b>I was unable to stop the 
attack by the Imperial army.</b>

12:04.990 --> 12:08.200
<b>I could not even quell the fears of 
the ministers during the meeting.</b>

12:09.330 --> 12:12.120
<b>I'm unfit to be a queen.</b>

12:12.870 --> 12:14.790
<b>Mother, please don't say that.</b>

12:15.000 --> 12:18.880
<b>Alice, you can't lose 
in the queen's election.</b>

12:18.880 --> 12:22.420
<b>If you do, the sovereignty may be destroyed.</b>

12:22.760 --> 12:27.300
<b>Mother, I share your 
concern for the future...</b>

12:27.680 --> 12:28.430
<b>However,</b>

12:32.180 --> 12:36.020
<b>I need you to keep doing what you do.</b>

12:36.020 --> 12:39.230
<b>I still have things that I must accomplish.</b>

12:40.190 --> 12:41.280
<b>What do you mean?</b>

12:41.860 --> 12:46.700
<b>I need to be close to you to support you
while I save Sisbell, for starters.</b>

12:50.950 --> 12:53.120
<b>I don't want to feel the way I did before.</b>

12:54.000 --> 12:57.670
<b>The anger and grief that throws any 
rational thinking out the window...</b>

12:59.040 --> 13:00.380
<b>I now know.</b>

13:00.670 --> 13:06.220
<b>The Imperial army's attack showed me 
that I can't save everything by myself.</b>

13:07.850 --> 13:12.270
<b>I'm counting on you, everyone, and Iska!</b>

13:13.180 --> 13:14.850
<b>If I can keep running....</b>

13:20.110 --> 13:24.650
<b>Can you give back my earring that you stole?</b>

13:24.650 --> 13:26.490
<b>Former Saint Disciple.</b>

13:26.490 --> 13:28.280
<b>Is this your way of negotiating?!</b>

13:28.530 --> 13:34.040
<b>No, I just need to take it back 
from you after you're crushed!</b>

13:34.040 --> 13:35.870
<b>Howler, let your wails be heard!</b>

13:38.880 --> 13:40.290
<b>Sound... attack?</b>

13:45.800 --> 13:47.680
<b>Smart move.</b>

13:53.310 --> 13:55.430
<b>I suppose this wall is thick enough.</b>

13:56.190 --> 14:00.360
<b>But now I'm as good as 
trapped in a confined space.</b>

14:02.360 --> 14:04.030
<b>Explosion this time?!</b>

14:06.280 --> 14:10.910
<b>You haven't seen what my pawns can do yet.</b>

14:10.910 --> 14:12.620
<b>Set ablaze.</b>

14:17.120 --> 14:20.460
<b>I almost died from that. I'm not 
going to fall for it this time.</b>

14:20.830 --> 14:22.840
<b>Release of Stars!</b>

14:23.880 --> 14:28.300
<b>So annoying. Tranquility, sweep away!</b>

14:29.430 --> 14:34.970
<b>You little Imperial soldier! How much 
power are you going to make me use?!</b>

14:34.970 --> 14:37.100
<b>Die already!</b>

14:39.310 --> 14:40.940
<b>No can do.</b>

14:41.190 --> 14:45.110
<b>This princess... She's extremely powerful.</b>

14:45.110 --> 14:47.030
<b>Attack him with everything you've got.</b>

14:47.490 --> 14:50.280
<b>I don't care if you break the earring,</b>

14:50.280 --> 14:53.780
<b>as long as he's obliterated without a trace.</b>

14:54.160 --> 14:55.290
<b>Kill him!</b>

14:59.040 --> 15:01.920
<b>Release of Stars!</b>

15:09.880 --> 15:11.890
<b>What is this?!</b>

15:14.220 --> 15:16.220
<b>What just happened?</b>

15:16.220 --> 15:19.600
<b>No, don't waver. There's no time to think!</b>

15:22.940 --> 15:23.860
<b>Hm?</b>

15:27.990 --> 15:33.070
<b>Don't get carried away 
too much, you old demon!</b>

15:34.030 --> 15:38.250
<b>How laughable. You quickly 
turned back into a human.</b>

15:38.250 --> 15:42.920
<b>I take it you don't want the 
researchers to see your ugly form.</b>

15:42.920 --> 15:46.920
<b>Shut up and stay put!
I'll catch up with you soon enough!</b>

15:47.380 --> 15:50.420
<b>I grow tired of seeing your face.</b>

15:52.050 --> 15:53.720
<b>Be gone.</b>

15:55.760 --> 16:01.310
<b>You...  will fear... the true witch's...</b>

16:01.310 --> 16:03.190
<b>Is that some kind of curse?</b>

16:05.480 --> 16:08.690
<b>Another uninvited guest.</b>

16:08.940 --> 16:11.700
<b>I finally found you, Princess of Hydra.</b>

16:11.700 --> 16:13.660
<b>Give me Gregorio's secret spell.</b>

16:13.660 --> 16:16.530
<b>Unfortunately, it isn't here.</b>

16:16.530 --> 16:20.830
<b>They were taken by someone 
who got here before you.</b>

16:20.830 --> 16:24.250
<b>Then give me the real secret spell.</b>

16:25.580 --> 16:29.460
<b>You're trying to tell me Hydra's record 
to create a monster was stolen?</b>

16:29.460 --> 16:30.920
<b>Don't lie to me.</b>

16:30.920 --> 16:34.680
<b>That was just a replica 
with only partial records.</b>

16:34.680 --> 16:37.600
<b>I want the original copy.</b>

16:37.600 --> 16:40.390
<b>You regretful demon!</b>

16:40.390 --> 16:45.100
<b>I'll teach you that you are nothing 
before the lineage of royalty!</b>

16:45.100 --> 16:49.020
<b>"Nobility comes not from bloodline 
but from one's philosophy."</b>

16:49.530 --> 16:52.360
<b>Arrogant with the power of the astral 
spirit you were born with,</b>

16:52.360 --> 16:55.700
<b>you lack the will to improve yourself.</b>

16:55.950 --> 16:59.120
<b>How can you call that a lineage of royalty?!</b>

17:00.200 --> 17:01.950
<b>You've got a big mouth!</b>

17:01.950 --> 17:07.460
<b>You're just some royalty. Do not 
talk to me in such a manner.</b>

17:09.090 --> 17:11.010
<b>Where is the original?</b>

17:11.010 --> 17:13.720
<b>Like I'd tell you.</b>

17:13.720 --> 17:16.930
<b>This is where you'll die!</b>

17:17.300 --> 17:19.140
<b>This isn't good.</b>

17:19.140 --> 17:25.060
<b>Snow the Sun glowed and then was on 
fire. I have no clue what's going on.</b>

17:25.060 --> 17:27.560
<b>What about the demon and 
the top members of the Sun?</b>

17:27.980 --> 17:30.400
<b>I'm not seeing anyone.</b>

17:30.400 --> 17:36.610
<b>But the demon and Mizerhyby may be 
having a fierce battle right now.</b>

17:37.110 --> 17:40.330
<b>So, I'm going to suggest we fall back.</b>

17:40.580 --> 17:43.080
<b>That's it from the field.</b>

17:46.290 --> 17:48.710
<b>Oops, I'm sorry.</b>

17:48.710 --> 17:53.010
<b>People always tell me I'm too tall...</b>

17:55.510 --> 17:56.630
<b>Mismis?!</b>

17:56.840 --> 17:58.140
<b>Noro?!</b>

17:58.510 --> 18:03.140
<b>Why would a captain from the Imperial 
army be in the Central Province?</b>

18:03.140 --> 18:04.390
<b>Ah, Mismis!</b>

18:04.390 --> 18:04.930
<b>Uh...</b>

18:04.930 --> 18:06.440
<b>Hey, boss. This way!</b>

18:06.440 --> 18:07.600
<b>R-Right!</b>

18:09.270 --> 18:10.480
<b>Mismis!</b>

18:11.150 --> 18:14.780
<b>Arrest that woman! She's an Imperial!</b>

18:16.200 --> 18:18.160
<b>I reported to Lady Alice</b>

18:18.570 --> 18:20.870
<b>that while Lady Sisbell could not be found,</b>

18:20.870 --> 18:23.740
<b>you did find Schwartz, 
captured in the basement.</b>

18:24.160 --> 18:26.790
<b>That's right. We also took photos for proof.</b>

18:28.210 --> 18:32.800
<b>Simply proving Lou's servant is being 
held captive by the Hydra family,</b>

18:32.800 --> 18:35.300
<b>will be enough to shake 
Talisman's stronghold.</b>

18:36.470 --> 18:39.010
<b>By the way, what happened to Salinger?</b>

18:39.010 --> 18:40.390
<b>Salinger?</b>

18:40.840 --> 18:43.140
<b>You didn't encounter him?</b>

18:44.390 --> 18:46.850
<b>I haven't even seen a sign of him.</b>

18:46.850 --> 18:52.520
<b>I see. Well, we can just confirm from 
Snow the Sun video surveillance.</b>

18:52.520 --> 18:54.360
<b>OK, it opened.</b>

18:54.900 --> 18:55.650
<b>Here it is.</b>

18:57.530 --> 19:01.820
<b>Hmm, there are two encrypted 
files that look like bad news.</b>

19:01.820 --> 19:04.330
<b>Looks like there's only one 
that we can open right now.</b>

19:05.290 --> 19:07.540
<b>What are these numbers with arrows?</b>

19:07.540 --> 19:12.670
<b>Maybe date and time? If it is, 
they left this place last night,</b>

19:12.670 --> 19:15.050
<b>and entered the Empire 
territory this morning.</b>

19:15.050 --> 19:20.050
<b>From the travel speed, it has to be an 
airplane. I wonder what they flew out?</b>

19:20.050 --> 19:24.260
<b>What? There are no airfields 
in this location.</b>

19:24.260 --> 19:25.890
<b>Huh? But...</b>

19:25.890 --> 19:28.890
<b>The arrows are originating 
from Hydra's private property.</b>

19:29.230 --> 19:33.900
<b>If they flew out a private plane from 
there, they must've flown out...</b>

19:34.190 --> 19:35.520
<b>Could it have been...?</b>

19:35.520 --> 19:36.610
<b>Sisbell.</b>

19:38.490 --> 19:42.160
<b>Rescuing Sisbell who's 
been moved to the Empire</b>

19:42.160 --> 19:44.330
<b>is going to jeopardize our status as well.</b>

19:44.620 --> 19:48.540
<b>Lady Sisbell's rescue is non-negotiable.</b>

19:49.040 --> 19:50.710
<b>We know that.</b>

19:50.710 --> 19:56.090
<b>But from our position, we can't infiltrate 
Imperial territory like we did here.</b>

19:56.090 --> 19:57.420
<b>Isn't that right, boss?</b>

19:57.420 --> 20:02.510
<b>R-Right. I also think helping
you directly will be difficult.</b>

20:02.720 --> 20:06.810
<b>I have one proposal. Captain Mismis.</b>

20:06.810 --> 20:08.100
<b>Y-Yes?!</b>

20:08.100 --> 20:13.520
<b>You didn't rescue Lady Sisbell,
but we will still allow you to leave.</b>

20:14.150 --> 20:17.110
<b>In exchange, you must agree 
to our last condition.</b>

20:17.570 --> 20:19.320
<b>W-Which is...?</b>

20:19.320 --> 20:21.240
<b>To have a spy follow you.</b>

20:21.570 --> 20:25.320
<b>You'll return to the Empire 
without noticing the spy.</b>

20:25.660 --> 20:26.530
<b>Huh?</b>

20:26.530 --> 20:32.160
<b>I see. That's probably the best we 
can do considering our position.</b>

20:32.580 --> 20:33.960
<b>Exactly.</b>

20:33.960 --> 20:38.170
<b>Basically, we'll leave the sovereignty 
with a spy that'll follow us.</b>

20:38.170 --> 20:40.960
<b>After entering the Imperial territory 
but before returning to the capital,</b>

20:40.960 --> 20:45.590
<b>we'll just happen to pass by the 
facility where Sisbell was taken.</b>

20:45.590 --> 20:48.760
<b>The spy will then go find Sisbell.
That's the gist, right?</b>

20:49.720 --> 20:51.350
<b>Boss, what do you think?</b>

20:51.350 --> 20:55.650
<b>Considering we can't leave the 
sovereignty unless we agree to this,</b>

20:55.650 --> 20:58.770
<b>I think this is the most we can afford to do.</b>

20:58.770 --> 21:00.400
<b>But Rin,</b>

21:00.400 --> 21:06.370
<b>we won't be able to help even if 
your spy fails to rescue Sisbell.</b>

21:06.370 --> 21:08.990
<b>We can't betray the Empire any further.</b>

21:08.990 --> 21:12.870
<b>I won't ask for more. 
We'll take it from there.</b>

21:13.290 --> 21:16.630
<b>This is it, then. Our last 
and final negotiation.</b>

21:19.340 --> 21:22.970
<b>If Lady Alice agrees to it, we have a deal.</b>

21:23.380 --> 21:25.090
<b>I understand the situation.</b>

21:25.630 --> 21:28.890
<b>Rin, let's move forward 
as you have negotiated.</b>

21:29.350 --> 21:33.140
<b>To be honest, I would 
love to go myself, but...</b>

21:33.600 --> 21:36.980
<b>It won't do good for you to act on 
this under the current circumstances.</b>

21:37.600 --> 21:40.570
<b>Right. I can't leave my mother alone.</b>

21:40.940 --> 21:43.110
<b>So I'll have to rely on my subordinate.</b>

21:43.110 --> 21:43.940
<b>Of course.</b>

21:44.400 --> 21:48.740
<b>However, the responsibility 
of this spy is significant.</b>

21:49.120 --> 21:51.660
<b>They must understand the current situation,</b>

21:51.660 --> 21:55.080
<b>and be able to rescue Lady 
Sisbell from the Empire.</b>

21:55.080 --> 21:56.210
<b>Thanks in advance!</b>

21:56.460 --> 21:57.120
<b>Huh?</b>

21:57.370 --> 21:59.210
<b>She's my precious sister.</b>

21:59.210 --> 22:02.000
<b>I can only entrust this to 
someone I absolutely trust.</b>

22:03.130 --> 22:05.050
<b>O-Of course!</b>

22:05.050 --> 22:10.140
<b>However, I was going to suggest the 
Royal Astral Guards, like Kisasage...</b>

22:10.140 --> 22:11.010
<b>No.</b>

22:12.100 --> 22:14.270
<b>There's a criteria to being our spy.</b>

22:14.270 --> 22:16.730
<b>They must know Iska and his team.</b>

22:16.730 --> 22:20.560
<b>Officially, they'll be following, but in reality,
they'll be accompanying them.</b>

22:21.820 --> 22:24.030
<b>Um, Lady Alice...</b>

22:24.030 --> 22:25.150
<b>What is it?</b>

22:25.150 --> 22:29.870
<b>As you know, I hate the 
Empire with a passion.</b>

22:29.870 --> 22:34.700
<b>Just seeing the Imperial territories 
on a map gives me goosebumps.</b>

22:34.700 --> 22:38.460
<b>If someone like me goes to the Empire...</b>

22:39.080 --> 22:43.590
<b>You must go to the Empire 
with Iska to rescue Sisbell.</b>

22:43.590 --> 22:46.970
<b>This is an honorable mission 
that only you can do!</b>

22:48.260 --> 22:50.140
<b>Now go, Rin!</b>

22:50.140 --> 22:55.100
<b>I don't wanna!</b>

23:08.490 --> 23:09.360
<b>Iska.</b>

23:08.490 --> 23:09.360
<b>Alice.</b>

23:11.660 --> 23:12.660
<b>Thanks.</b>

23:14.120 --> 23:16.700
<b>Now, off to the Empire.</b>

23:14.120 --> 23:16.700
<b>Now, off to the Empire.</b>
